        "Content": "Keller Williams Team Castle are delighted to present 30 Forbes quay to the  market. This is a fantastic One bedroom apartment in excellent condition throughout. Bright with lovely clean lines, solid timber flooring, an integrated kitchen,a stylish bathroom, fully furnished and plenty of storage space. There is also an underground secure parking garage with one dedicated parking space.\r\n\r\nForbes Quay is situated between Sir John Rogerson's Quay and Grand Canal Dock, This fabulous neighbourhood has a host of fashionable bars, cafes, restaurants, convenience stores and The Board Gais Theatre. You are within walking distance of the Aviva Stadium, the 3 Arena and The Convention Centre Dublin,the IFSC. The city centre is a 15 minute walk away. The Grand Canal DART station and the Spencer Dock LUAS are also a short stroll away. There is also an underground secure parking garage with one dedicated parking space."
      },
